# CIF file
# Synthetic test structure written by the httk authors from the published
# structure parameters of COD 2019502 (disordered kalsilite KAlSiO4):
# A. Kremenovic, P. Vulic, Acta Cryst. C 70 (2014) 256;
# https://doi.org/10.1107/S2053229614002423 (structure data only).
#
# It exercises half-occupied split positions, one species (O) spread over
# several partially occupied sites, and a fully occupied site.
#
